# 0. PROJECT MISSION

You are working on DOCULENS, an existing universal AI-powered document intelligence web application.

Your mission is to transform the existing DOCULENS application into a polished, intelligent, reliable and comprehensive document analysis platform.

DOCULENS must allow a user to upload a document, automatically understand its purpose, extract all available information, analyze every important detail, identify missing requirements, generate actionable checklists and present the findings through a beautiful, organized, multi-page user interface.

The application must support individuals, students, employees, freelancers, startups, SMEs, enterprises, colleges, NGOs, government-related organizations and other users.

This is an enhancement of an existing product.

**DO NOT BUILD A NEW APPLICATION FROM SCRATCH.**

Inspect the existing project, preserve its architecture and features, and improve what already exists.

The final product should feel like a premium, modern, intelligent SaaS platform.

